---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Disclosure"
  description="Garage Sidequests principles for affiliate links, sponsorships, supplied products, and editorial independence."
>
  <article class="reading">
    <div class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">SITE NOTES</p>
      <h1>Disclosure</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Garage Sidequests documents real projects and their outcomes, including
        things that fail or change direction.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        No affiliate links are configured for V1. If affiliate links are added,
        they will be identified near the relevant content. Purchases through
        those links may earn Garage Sidequests a commission at no additional
        cost to the buyer.
      </p>
      <h2>Sponsorships and supplied products</h2>
      <p>
        Sponsored content and products supplied for review will be disclosed in
        the relevant project or article when applicable. No sponsorship or
        supplied-product relationship is being claimed here.
      </p>
      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>
        Financial relationships should not determine project conclusions.
        Documentation will distinguish measured results, personal observations,
        and open questions. Paid products and commercial links will be clearly
        identified.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about a relationship or link?{" "}
        <a href="mailto:hello@garagesidequests.com">
          hello@garagesidequests.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
